kavis-panel (1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Grup C taskbar stages: right region that is never squeezed,
    icon-only window buttons (W11), indicator popups (calendar,
    battery+power plan, language, volume), llvmpipe trap closed with
    GDK_GL=disable.
  * Madde 60: popup outside-click rule fixed at a single root (root
    coordinate test + GTK grab + seat grab retry).
  * Grup D: centered cluster + acrylic (madde 4); right-click menu —
    position/size/monitor/auto-hide (madde 5); notification
    infrastructure org.freedesktop.Notifications + notification center
    + quick settings (madde 37); kavis-snap edge-snapping binary
    (madde 6); Win+Tab overview + focus + org.kavis.Panel bridge
    (madde 55); clipboard history (Win+V) + volume OSD (madde 7). The
    string table moved to kavis-common (shared with kavis-tools).

