kavis-panel (1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Panel ported from Python to Vala (madde 3): 117 MB of RAM was
    unacceptable. Same look and behavior; business logic under
    src/logic/, UI under src/ui/. Direct libX11 for the strut instead
    of python3-xlib. setxkbmap's package (x11-xkb-utils) added to the
    dependencies — it used to be missing and the keyboard indicator
    silently fell back to "TR".

